# Local agent substrate, including sandcastle's git worktrees — those are nested
# repositories, so committing the directory records a bare gitlink that no clone
# can resolve. Matches how LIB-design-system ignores it.
#
# The skills and the standards/tracker docs they read are kept local rather than
# published with the package. Sandcastle sandboxes are git worktrees and so do not
# contain ignored files — both trees reach an agent through `copyToWorktree` in
# `.sandcastle/main.ts` instead. If either is renamed, that list has to move with it.
.claude/
.sandcastle/
docs/agents/
